        "tree_id": "45455c866c5f1b03d399d612a5313e6f7a772b4f",
        "message": "fix(harness): preserve verification and memory/reflection trust\n\nRun discovered verification recipes without splitting shell syntax or adding\nchanged paths, prioritize canonical root entrypoints, and upgrade stale hints.\n\nGate memory retrieval by trusted session and lifecycle visibility, persist\ncandidate metadata across SQLite operations and migration, and scan the\nstructured lesson text that reaches the model.\n\nReflect only on the target turn and serialize durable journal appends before\nannouncing outputs or admitting candidates. Keep denial audit failures visible.\n\nAdd deterministic regression cases and portable offline production probes.\nCore architecture and learning promotion policy remain unchanged.",
